{
  "id": "charismatic-leader",
  "term": "charismatic leader",
  "definition": "A charismatic leader is a leader seen as especially able to attract, inspire, and influence other people through a compelling personal style and strong communication. In this context, such a leader’s perceptions, emotions, attitudes, and behaviors may spread to followers, who can themselves come to be seen as more charismatic over time.",
